Error [E0930]: `#Meta` arguments do not match `Meta(category: String = "", tunable: Bool = false, maturity: Maturity = .Tested)`
  --> tests/ui/meta_duplicate_field.jet:2:6
    |
  2 |     #Meta(category: "Movement", category: "Physics") speed :: 10
    |      ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: marker arguments use the same call grammar and typed signature as function arguments
 Fix: match the registered signature `Meta(category: String = "", tunable: Bool = false, maturity: Maturity = .Tested)`
